# Cool but Rude, level 3: "When this Class becomes level 3, search your library for a card, put it into your hand, shuffle,
# then discard a card at random." Turn 1 Bot1 empties its hand into the Class and its two levels, so the only card in hand
# when the search ends is the Lightning Bolt it found: the random discard can only take it (the library keeps its other ten
# cards). That discard is one of Bot1's, so the level 2 ability deals 2 damage to Bot2 (CR 701.9, 716.2a).

